        <link>http://alephnull.com/w/recipes/salmon_marinades?rev=1499275186&amp;do=diff</link>
        <description>Salmon Marinades:

1. Sesame marinade:

	*  4 tablespoons sesami oil
	*  2 tablespoons tamari or soy sauce
	*  2 tablespoons lime juice
	*  1 clove garlic, minced
	*  3 green onions (scallions), chopped

Blend all ingredients and pour over salmon fillets or steaks to marinade.</description>
